{"id":1130601,"chapter_id":1130601,"scene_id":1,"steps":[{"step":1,"content":"你推开门时，琳正垂着头发呆。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601003,"trial_step":3,"drawing":1113060},{"step":2,"content":"一见到有人进来，少女便又往椅子里瑟缩了下，她脑袋上笨重的头盔看上去几乎要把那纤弱的身躯压垮了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601004,"trial_step":4,"drawing":1113060},{"step":3,"content":"你们前段日子一起在狄斯卡大闹了这么久，你早就发现她禁闭者的身份。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601005,"trial_step":5,"drawing":1113060},{"step":4,"content":"带她回到管理局后，你立刻让夜莺着手调查这位自称“独眼恶魔”的禁闭者。果不其然，你发现了她和一起校园事件有所关联。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601006,"trial_step":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":5,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":6,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":7,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置3","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":8,"options":["选择1"],"jump":[5],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":9,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置4","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":10,"options":["选择1","选择2"],"jump":[7,9],"style":4,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":11,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择1","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":12,"content":"测试选项的跳过配置5，对应选择2","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":1,"trial_step":7,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":13,"content":"终端里正播放着一条看着有些掉帧的录像视频，录像中，一位金色头发的少女，捂着自己的眼睛匆忙逃离现场。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601008,"trial_step":8,"drawing":1113060},{"step":14,"content":"她身上的服饰，发尾的夹子，都证明了这位就是现在正坐在审查室等待审查的那名禁闭者——琳。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601009,"trial_step":9,"drawing":1113060},{"step":15,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"作为近年来引起社会讨论最多的校园案件，“新城学校事件”由于疑点颇多，至今真相不明。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601010,"trial_step":10,"drawing":1113060},{"step":16,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"传闻中此案的肇事者是“新城的独眼恶魔”，其手段极为恶劣，令人发指。","style":1,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601011,"trial_step":11,"drawing":1113060},{"step":17,"content":"你知道那是琳的外号，但回忆起之前的相处，你并不认为她会做出主动伤人的行为。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601012,"trial_step":12,"drawing":1113060},{"step":18,"content":"你怀疑其中另有隐情——琳不一定是始作俑者，就算是，你也希望知道她为什么要这么做。","style":3,"background":1017,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601013,"trial_step":13,"drawing":1113060},{"step":19,"content":"好久不见，琳。在管理局生活得还习惯吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601015,"trial_step":15,"drawing":1113060},{"step":20,"speaker":"琳","content":"我、我很好……谢谢您的关心……局长先生。","female_content":"我、我很好……谢谢您的关心……局长小姐。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601016,"trial_step":16,"drawing":1113060},{"step":21,"content":"眼前这名胆小怯懦的少女，怎么看都不太能和传言里残忍恐怖的“独眼恶魔”画上等号。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601017,"trial_step":17,"drawing":1113060},{"step":22,"content":"但想要查清楚真相，你就必须得从她这里了解到更详细的信息，尤其是眼前这个巨大的头盔。琳在逃离现场时，还未带上它。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601018,"trial_step":18,"drawing":1113060},{"step":23,"content":"看着蜷缩在座椅里的琳，你不忍采取过于强硬的手段，于是打算更迂回委婉一些。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601019,"trial_step":19,"drawing":1113060},{"step":24,"content":"你不用太紧张，我只是想和你随意聊聊。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601020,"trial_step":20,"drawing":1113060},{"step":25,"speaker":"琳","content":"嗯……好的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601021,"trial_step":21,"drawing":1113060},{"step":26,"content":"琳虽然点头答应下来，但依旧唯唯诺诺的，你不由叹了口气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601022,"trial_step":22,"drawing":1113060},{"step":27,"options":["转移话题","坚持沟通"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601023,"trial_step":23,"course":3,"drawing":1113060,"choices":[{"text":"转移话题","goto":24},{"text":"坚持沟通","goto":24}]},{"step":28,"content":"你身上的小饰品，都是自己做的吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601024,"trial_step":24,"drawing":1113060},{"step":29,"speaker":"琳","content":"……诶？是……是的！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601025,"trial_step":25,"drawing":1113060},{"step":30,"speaker":"琳","content":"那个……有什么问题吗……？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601026,"trial_step":26,"drawing":1113060},{"step":31,"content":"没什么，我就是觉得它们……嗯，非常可爱。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601027,"trial_step":27,"drawing":1113060},{"step":32,"content":"看来你蛮擅长做手工的。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601028,"trial_step":28,"drawing":1113060},{"step":33,"speaker":"琳","content":"唔……谢谢……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601029,"trial_step":29,"drawing":1113061},{"step":34,"content":"听到你的夸奖，琳不好意思起来，却似乎没那么拘谨了，看来你找对了切入口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601030,"trial_step":30,"drawing":1113061},{"step":35,"content":"衣服上的花边也是你自己设计的吧，很有巧思！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601031,"trial_step":31,"drawing":1113061},{"step":36,"content":"还有挂在相机上的玩偶，挺迷你的，但做工看上去非常精致。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601032,"trial_step":32,"drawing":1113061},{"step":37,"content":"你真的很厉害。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601033,"trial_step":33,"drawing":1113061},{"step":38,"content":"琳被这一连串的夸赞弄得晕乎乎的，彻底不知所措了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601034,"trial_step":34,"drawing":1113061},{"step":39,"speaker":"琳","content":"谢……谢谢！局长先生……也很厉害，观察得很仔细呢……","female_content":"谢……谢谢！局长小姐……能注意到这么细节的东西……真厉害……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601035,"trial_step":35,"drawing":1113061},{"step":40,"content":"看得出来，你很喜欢这些可爱的小装饰，所以现在的高中生，在流行这样的东西吗？真青春啊……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601036,"trial_step":36,"drawing":1113061},{"step":41,"speaker":"琳","content":"大……大概吧……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601037,"trial_step":37,"drawing":1113061},{"step":42,"content":"那之后，我带你去见见夏音吧，她也很喜欢很了解这些高中女生喜爱的东西。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601038,"trial_step":38,"drawing":1113061},{"step":43,"speaker":"琳","content":"真的吗……？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601039,"trial_step":39,"drawing":1113061},{"step":44,"content":"是啊~而且，她很喜欢动漫里那些看上去非同一般的人物造型——你戴着这么特别的头盔，她一定会对你很感兴趣。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601040,"trial_step":40,"drawing":1113061},{"step":45,"content":"你们或许，能成为不错的朋友。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601041,"trial_step":41,"drawing":1113061},{"step":46,"speaker":"琳","content":"什么？！我的、我的头盔……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601042,"trial_step":42,"drawing":1113063},{"step":47,"content":"一提到“头盔”，琳的身子又僵住了，语气也变得紧张起来。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601043,"trial_step":43,"drawing":1113063},{"step":48,"speaker":"琳","content":"这……这就是个普通的头盔，不特别……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601044,"trial_step":44,"drawing":1113063},{"step":49,"content":"这样吗……","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601045,"trial_step":45,"drawing":1113063},{"step":50,"content":"我听夜莺和禁闭者们说，你无论什么时候都不肯摘下头盔。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601046,"trial_step":46,"drawing":1113063},{"step":51,"content":"既然它不是什么特殊的道具，那我能问问你，为什么不愿意摘下来吗？它看上去有点沉重，整天戴着肯定很不舒服吧。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601047,"trial_step":47,"drawing":1113063},{"step":52,"speaker":"琳","content":"不能摘！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601048,"trial_step":48,"drawing":1113062},{"step":53,"speaker":"琳","content":"绝对……绝对不可以！如果摘下了……会发生可怕的事！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601049,"trial_step":49,"drawing":1113062},{"step":54,"content":"隔着头盔你无法辨清琳的神情，但从她颤抖的声音中，你听出了她的恐惧与后怕。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601050,"trial_step":50,"drawing":1113062},{"step":55,"content":"别害怕，我不是要摘……我不会强迫你的，琳。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601051,"trial_step":51,"drawing":1113062},{"step":56,"speaker":"琳","content":"唔……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601052,"trial_step":52,"drawing":1113060},{"step":57,"options":["继续安抚"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601053,"trial_step":53,"course":3,"drawing":1113060,"choices":[{"text":"继续安抚","goto":54}]},{"step":58,"content":"你现在归属管理局了，琳。没有我的命令，任何人都不能动你。而我也会保护你，不受任何你所说的“可怕的事”威胁。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601054,"trial_step":54,"drawing":1113060},{"step":59,"speaker":"琳","content":"您……您会保护我？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601055,"trial_step":55,"drawing":1113060},{"step":60,"content":"琳小心翼翼地问着，带着些难以置信。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601056,"trial_step":56,"drawing":1113060},{"step":61,"content":"是的，这是我的职责。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601057,"trial_step":57,"drawing":1113060},{"step":62,"speaker":"琳","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601058,"trial_step":58,"drawing":1113060},{"step":63,"content":"如果看在我们曾在狄莱坞相处过的份上，你愿意信任我的话……我希望你能告诉我，究竟发生过什么。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601059,"trial_step":59,"drawing":1113060},{"step":64,"content":"我会保护你，不让这些可怕的事靠近你，又或者是避免这些可怕的事发生。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601060,"trial_step":60,"drawing":1113060},{"step":65,"content":"但……这需要你能对我坦白，我才知道该如何帮助你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601061,"trial_step":61,"drawing":1113060},{"step":66,"content":"琳的头垂得更低了。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601062,"trial_step":62,"drawing":1113060},{"step":67,"speaker":"琳","content":"……您真的想知道吗？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601063,"trial_step":63,"drawing":1113060},{"step":68,"content":"见你点头，少女深呼吸了好几次后，才磕磕绊绊地开口。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601064,"trial_step":64,"drawing":1113060},{"step":69,"speaker":"琳","content":"头盔……是他们逼我戴的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601065,"trial_step":65,"drawing":1113060},{"step":70,"speaker":"琳","content":"我们家是……迁入新城的辛迪加移民，因为这个原因，我的同学都……看不起我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601066,"trial_step":66,"drawing":1113060},{"step":71,"speaker":"琳","content":"他们嘲笑我是“西区来的脏怪物”，还会捉弄我，逼我帮他们跑腿之类的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601067,"trial_step":67,"drawing":1113060},{"step":72,"content":"你有向老师和家长反映过这些事吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601068,"trial_step":68,"drawing":1113060},{"step":73,"speaker":"琳","content":"嗯，有的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601069,"trial_step":69,"drawing":1113060},{"step":74,"speaker":"琳","content":"只是……老师不怎么在意这些学生间的“打闹”，我的父母虽然很关心我……但他们总是劝我要保持忍耐。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601070,"trial_step":70,"drawing":1113060},{"step":75,"speaker":"琳","content":"妈妈说，只要不惹恼这些人，就能继续在新城过平静的生活……所以我会，乖乖听话……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601071,"trial_step":71,"drawing":1113060},{"step":76,"speaker":"琳","content":"如果只是那种程度的恶作剧就好了……可是、可是……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601072,"trial_step":72,"drawing":1113060},{"step":77,"content":"琳有些说不下去了，仿佛这段话已经耗尽了她积攒起来的勇气。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601073,"trial_step":73,"drawing":1113060},{"step":78,"options":["耐心鼓励"],"style":6,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601074,"trial_step":74,"course":3,"drawing":1113060,"choices":[{"text":"耐心鼓励","goto":75}]},{"step":79,"content":"没关系的，琳。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601075,"trial_step":75,"drawing":1113060},{"step":80,"content":"能把这些话说出口，就已经很勇敢了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601076,"trial_step":76,"drawing":1113060},{"step":81,"content":"你可以慢慢来，我绝不会像那些人一样嘲笑你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601077,"trial_step":77,"drawing":1113060},{"step":82,"content":"琳惴惴不安地缩起肩膀，终于，还是继续说道。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601078,"trial_step":78,"drawing":1113060},{"step":83,"speaker":"琳","content":"在我生日那天……我收到了一台相机作为生日礼物，从此之后……就喜欢上了摄影。摄影……会让我感到很快乐。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601079,"trial_step":79,"drawing":1113060},{"step":84,"speaker":"琳","content":"因、因为……小小的取景框，能装下很多很多东西，在这些东西里面，那些嘲笑和排挤……小得都看不见了……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601080,"trial_step":80,"drawing":1113060},{"step":85,"speaker":"琳","content":"摄影能让我……把这些烦恼都忘掉。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601081,"trial_step":81,"drawing":1113060},{"step":86,"speaker":"琳","content":"啊……我说的话……很不知所谓吧，抱、抱歉……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601082,"trial_step":82,"drawing":1113060},{"step":87,"content":"你不需要道歉。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601083,"trial_step":83,"drawing":1113060},{"step":88,"content":"不是每个人都能在受到伤害后第一时间走出来，你并没有做错。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601084,"trial_step":84,"drawing":1113060},{"step":89,"content":"而且，有爱好不是件好事吗？毕竟它能让你快乐起来。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601085,"trial_step":85,"drawing":1113060},{"step":90,"speaker":"琳","content":"好事……吗……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601086,"trial_step":86,"drawing":1113060},{"step":91,"speaker":"琳","content":"可他们，不是这么说的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601087,"trial_step":87,"drawing":1113060},{"step":92,"speaker":"琳","content":"我最喜欢拍流民寨和辛迪加，就算别人觉得那里很脏很乱……可在我看来，它们都比新城冷冰冰的高楼要更有生气……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601088,"trial_step":88,"drawing":1113060},{"step":93,"speaker":"琳","content":"我的同学本来就很嫌弃我到处拍来拍去，被他们发现我拍这种内容后，我的处境……就更艰难了……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601089,"trial_step":89,"drawing":1113060},{"step":94,"speaker":"琳","content":"戴上头盔……就是因为他们说我拍的东西那么丑，一定是眼睛丑，眼神有问题，说不想看到我的眼睛……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601090,"trial_step":90,"drawing":1113060},{"step":95,"speaker":"琳","content":"没用的东西还不如全部遮起来，这样就不会……呜……碍别人的眼……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601091,"trial_step":91,"drawing":1113060},{"step":96,"content":"琳讲着讲着，控制不住地染上了哭腔。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601092,"trial_step":92,"drawing":1113060},{"step":97,"content":"接着她顿了一下，才用细如蚊吟的声音说。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601093,"trial_step":93,"drawing":1113060},{"step":98,"speaker":"琳","content":"所以我才不愿意摘下头盔……我害怕自己……会更惹人讨厌。","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601094,"trial_step":94,"drawing":1113060},{"step":99,"content":"……相信我，这里没人会这么对你。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601095,"trial_step":95,"drawing":1113060},{"step":100,"speaker":"琳","content":"对不起……您就当这是我的习惯吧……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601096,"trial_step":96,"drawing":1113060},{"step":101,"speaker":"琳","content":"只有戴着头盔，我才觉得安全……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601097,"trial_step":97,"drawing":1113060},{"step":102,"content":"琳的陈述痛苦而真挚，她的确将自己的过往剖开了呈现在你面前。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601098,"trial_step":98,"drawing":1113060},{"step":103,"content":"只不过，你知道她还是隐瞒了一些事情。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601099,"trial_step":99,"drawing":1113060},{"step":104,"content":"测试音效的打断逻辑","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":105,"content":"播放一个长音效，会有个前奏，稍等一会儿。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":106,"content":"播放相同音效，会继续延续。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":107,"content":"暂停配置音效，这里测试一下打断。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":108,"content":"播放一个稍短的音效，在这里等待它结束。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":109,"content":"配置同名音效，看能否再次播放。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":110,"content":"结束测试。","style":18,"log_type":1,"src_id":2,"trial_step":100,"course":6,"drawing":1113060},{"step":111,"content":"你查到了“新城学校事件”中受害者的个人资料，其中包括他们的日常行为和风评。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601101,"trial_step":101,"drawing":1113060},{"step":112,"content":"你对这起事件的起因，有了不一样的推测。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601102,"trial_step":102,"drawing":1113060},{"step":113,"content":"你掏掏口袋，将一个东西递到琳的手里。琳接过来一看，朝你歪了歪头，表示不解。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601103,"trial_step":103,"drawing":1113060},{"step":114,"content":"嗷呜给我的，说是什么……勇气糖果。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601104,"trial_step":104,"drawing":1113060},{"step":115,"content":"接下来我问的问题，可能会让你有些害怕，但我还是那句话……我希望你信任我。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601105,"trial_step":105,"drawing":1113060},{"step":116,"content":"琳手里紧攥着糖果，默默地点了点头。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601106,"trial_step":106,"drawing":1113060},{"step":117,"content":"最近类似的校园事件，似乎爆发了不少。而其中有一起……就发生在你的学校。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601107,"trial_step":107,"drawing":1113060},{"step":118,"content":"琳，你听说过“新城学校事件”吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601108,"trial_step":108,"drawing":1113060},{"step":119,"speaker":"琳","content":"啊……是的……但我，我不太清楚……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601109,"trial_step":109,"drawing":1113062},{"step":120,"content":"琳非常明显地心虚起来，脑袋不自觉地垂得更低。你却佯装没有发现。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601110,"trial_step":110,"drawing":1113062},{"step":121,"content":"为了确保新城的学生精神状态和M值在稳定状态，管理局也会让FAC对此进行一些调查。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601111,"trial_step":111,"drawing":1113062},{"step":122,"content":"我调查到这起事件中，那些受伤的学生虽然伤势比较重，却没什么人去关心探望他们。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601112,"trial_step":112,"drawing":1113062},{"step":123,"content":"你知道原因吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601113,"trial_step":113,"drawing":1113062},{"step":124,"speaker":"琳","content":"为、为什么……？","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601114,"trial_step":114,"drawing":1113062},{"step":125,"content":"因为他们……都有过欺辱同窗的卑劣行径。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601115,"trial_step":115,"drawing":1113062},{"step":126,"speaker":"琳","content":"……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601116,"trial_step":116,"drawing":1113062},{"step":127,"content":"看来作恶者终遭报应，也是大家喜闻乐见的下场。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601117,"trial_step":117,"drawing":1113062},{"step":128,"content":"很多人说，凭他们犯下的错，在医院里躺段时间算是活该。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601118,"trial_step":118,"drawing":1113062},{"step":129,"content":"你也是这么认为的吗，琳？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601119,"trial_step":119,"drawing":1113062},{"step":130,"speaker":"琳","content":"啊……我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601120,"trial_step":120,"drawing":1113062},{"step":131,"content":"这样……你会不再那么害怕吗？","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601121,"trial_step":121,"drawing":1113062},{"step":132,"speaker":"琳","content":"我……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601122,"trial_step":122,"drawing":1113062},{"step":133,"content":"琳被问得呆住了，支吾半天也吐不出完整的句子。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601123,"trial_step":123,"drawing":1113062},{"step":134,"content":"突然，她猛地将自己蜷缩成一团，发出了凄厉而惶恐的悲鸣。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601124,"trial_step":124,"drawing":1113064},{"step":135,"speaker":"琳","content":"我不是……不是故意的！！！","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601125,"trial_step":125,"drawing":1113064},{"step":136,"speaker":"琳","content":"我很抱歉……！是他们、他们先……我只是，太害怕了……呜呜呜……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601126,"trial_step":126,"drawing":1113064},{"step":137,"content":"琳双手死死按着头盔，生怕它被人夺走一般。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601127,"trial_step":127,"drawing":1113064},{"step":138,"speaker":"琳","content":"我是个怪物……我不想、不想伤害任何人的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601128,"trial_step":128,"drawing":1113064},{"step":139,"speaker":"琳","content":"我也不知道是怎么回事，那束光就从我的眼睛里……我、我也很怕啊……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601129,"trial_step":129,"drawing":1113064},{"step":140,"speaker":"琳","content":"我只有，戴上头盔……才不会……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601130,"trial_step":130,"drawing":1113064},{"step":141,"content":"通过她语无伦次的只言片语，你确认了自己的推想——在某次过分的戏弄中，琳的能力失控，误伤到了他人。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601131,"trial_step":131,"drawing":1113064},{"step":142,"content":"但你也没有料到，她的应激反应会这么强烈。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601132,"trial_step":132,"drawing":1113064},{"step":143,"content":"琳！冷静一点！","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601133,"trial_step":133,"drawing":1113064},{"step":144,"content":"嘘——我知道你很害怕，但已经没有人能够伤害你，也不会再有人被你伤害了。","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601134,"trial_step":134,"drawing":1113064},{"step":145,"content":"那些事情，都过去了——","style":2,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601135,"trial_step":135,"drawing":1113064},{"step":146,"speaker":"琳","content":"不、不会过去的……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601136,"trial_step":136,"drawing":1113064},{"step":147,"speaker":"琳","content":"我已经是怪物了……呜呜……已经是了……","style":1,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601137,"trial_step":137,"drawing":1113064},{"step":148,"content":"琳目前的心理状态濒临崩溃，审查无法再进行下去。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601138,"trial_step":138,"drawing":1113064},{"step":149,"content":"虽然你已经大致理清了事件的原因，但你并不认为事情可以到此为止。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601139,"trial_step":139,"drawing":1113064},{"step":150,"content":"你心中的内疚和冲动驱使着你……要再为这个迷失的女孩做些什么。","style":3,"log_type":1,"src_id":230601140,"trial_step":140,"drawing":1113064}]}